{"id":"torrey:chariots","source":"torrey","name":"Chariots","slug":"chariots","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Carriages for travelling, &c — Ge 46:29.","refs":[["Gen",46,29,46,29]]},{"text":"Carriages used in war — 1Ki 20:25.","refs":[["1Kgs",20,25,20,25]]},{"text":"Wheels of, described — 1Ki 7:33.","refs":[["1Kgs",7,33,7,33]]},{"text":"Bound with traces — Mic 1:13.","refs":[["Mic",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Horses. — 2Ki 10:2; Song 1:9.","refs":[["2Kgs",10,2,10,2],["Song",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Asses and camels. — Isa 21:7.","refs":[["Isa",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Value of in Solomon’s time — 1Ki 10:29.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,29,10,29]]},{"text":"Drivers generally employed for — 1Ki 22:34; 2Ch 18:33.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,34,22,34],["2Chr",18,33,18,33]]},{"text":"Sometimes driven by the owners — 2Ki 9:16,20.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,16,9,16],["2Kgs",9,20,9,20]]},{"text":"Sometimes driven furiously — 2Ki 9:20; Isa 5:28; Jer 4:13.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,20,9,20],["Isa",5,28,5,28],["Jer",4,13,4,13]]},{"text":"Bounding motion of, referred to — Na 3:2.","refs":[["Nah",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Noise occasioned by, referred to — 2Ki 7:6; Joe 2:5; Na 3:2; Re 9:9.","refs":[["2Kgs",7,6,7,6],["Joel",2,5,2,5],["Nah",3,2,3,2],["Rev",9,9,9,9]]},{"text":"Introduced into Israel by David — 2Sa 8:4.","refs":[["2Sam",8,4,8,4]]},{"text":"Multiplied by Solomon — 1Ki 10:26.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,26,10,26]]},{"text":"Imported from Egypt — 1Ki 10:28,29.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,28,10,28],["1Kgs",10,29,10,29]]},{"text":"Armed with iron. — Jos 17:16; Jdj 1:19.","refs":[["Josh",17,16,17,16],["Judg",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"Lighted by night with torches. — Na 2:3.","refs":[["Nah",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Commanded by captains. — Ex 14:7; 1Ki 16:9.","refs":[["Exod",14,7,14,7],["1Kgs",16,9,16,9]]},{"text":"Advantageously manoeuvred in a flat country. — Jdj 1:19; 1Ki 20:23-25.","refs":[["Judg",1,19,1,19],["1Kgs",20,23,20,25]]},{"text":"Formed part of the line of battle. — 1Ki 20:25.","refs":[["1Kgs",20,25,20,25]]},{"text":"Used in pursuing